    your GY, then Ritual Summon 1 "Nekroz" Ritual Monster from your hand whose Level
    exactly equals the total Levels of those monsters. You can only use this effect
    of "Nekroz Mirror" once per turn. If you control no monsters: You can banish
    this card and 1 "Nekroz" monster from your GY; add 1 "Nekroz" Spell from your
    Deck to your hand.'
